      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST FOR KICKS (6) took the sit on the lead but levelled up to score (19.89) at this track in a Grade 5 over 350m. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Has put together a string of wins and expected to go close again. CALL TO ARMS (1) flew the lids from out wide with an impressive turn of foot before finishing second (20.30) and beaten 4.5 lengths over 350m at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Expecting another good run. LUMIERE (2) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only a nose (20.29) behind GUS THE GANGSTER at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from three starts. Bold showing expected. VERMENTINO (3) generally performs well here at this distance.",
